Author: Henry <henry.krupp@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Aug 15 18:46:16 2025 +0200

    Add MCP Memory Service to Python General-Purpose Machine Learning
    
    MCP Memory Service is a universal memory service that provides:
    - Semantic search using sentence transformers and vector embeddings
    - Autonomous memory consolidation with ML-inspired algorithms
    - Multi-client support for 13+ AI applications (Claude Desktop, VS Code, Cursor, etc.)
    - Production-ready deployment with SQLite-vec and ChromaDB backends
    - Model Context Protocol (MCP) server implementation for AI assistants
    
    The service enables persistent memory and intelligent search capabilities
    for AI applications and ML development environments, making it a valuable
    addition to the Python machine learning ecosystem.

